WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.048
Today’s lesson goal: Today’s lesson goal: spot risky prompts and outputs. Add clear refusal and escalation rules. Keep user data out of places it should not go.

2
00:00:12.898 --> 00:00:25.114
Practical safety habits: Practical safety habits: do not paste secrets into prompts. Refuse harmful or disallowed requests. Document what the system must never do.

3
00:00:25.964 --> 00:00:38.996
Worked example: support bot: Worked example: a support bot may summarise tickets from provided text. It must not invent refunds or legal advice. It must escalate threats to a human.

4
00:00:39.846 --> 00:00:52.206
Practice checkpoint: Practice checkpoint: write a short safety checklist for your use case. Add two refusal test prompts. Then continue in the written Module 5 lesson.
